      "applicationProcess": "Book your driving theory test for: cars motorcycles lorries, buses and coaches, including the Driver Certificate of Professional Competence ( CPC ) part 1a and 1b (theory) and part 2 (case studies) This page is also available in Welsh (Cymraeg) . Book a test online You need your: UK driving licence number email address credit or debit card"
