      "applicationProcess": "Check details of a job applicant’s right to work in the UK, including: the types of work they’re allowed to do how long they can work in the UK for, if there’s a time limit You’ll need the job applicant’s: date of birth right to work share code You can also check someone’s original documents instead - for example if you do not have a share code. British and Irish citizens cannot get a share code. You can check their physical documents yourself or use an online identity service provider (IDSP) to check them."
