      ],
      "applicationProcess": "Use this service to estimate how much Income Tax and National Insurance you should pay for the current tax year (6 April 2026 to 5 April 2027). This guide is also available in Welsh (Cymraeg) . This service is for employees who pay tax and National Insurance each month through their employer. It tells you what your take-home pay will be after: paying tax making any pension contributions making any student loan repayments If you’re registered for Self Assessment, the Self Assessment tax calculator can help you estimate your tax bill. You may be able to claim a refund if you’ve paid too much tax."
    },
