      "applicationProcess": "Renew your driving licence online with DVLA for free if you’re 70 or over - or will be 70 in the next 90 days. This page is also available in Welsh (Cymraeg) . Renew online You’ll need to sign in to use this service. If you do not already have sign in details, you’ll be able to create them. You’ll be told when you sign in if you need to prove your identity. This is to keep your details safe and usually involves using photo ID like a passport or driving licence."
