        {
          "@type": "ServiceChannel",
          "serviceUrl": "https://www.check-your-visa-processing-time.homeoffice.gov.uk/location"
        }
      ],
      "applicationProcess": "Use this service to check when you can expect a decision on your visa application. Who can use this service You can use this service if you applied for a visa to: study visit as a tourist or see family and friends work or attend a business event get married or enter into a civil partnership have medical treatment travel through (‘transit’) on the way to another country You can also use this service if you applied for a visa as a British National Overseas (BNO) with connections to Hong Kong. Before you start You’ll need the date you verified your identity by either: using the ‘UK Immigration: ID Check’ phone app visiting a visa application centre – for example, VFS Global You can estimate the date if you’re not sure."
    },
