        }
      ],
      "applicationProcess": "You can use this service to make a payment by Visa, Mastercard or Maestro debit card. Money usually takes less than 3 working days to reach a prisoner’s account, but it may take longer. This service is free, secure and available in all prisons in England and Wales. You can no longer send money by bank transfer, cheque, postal order or send cash by post to any prison. You’ll need to use a debit card instead."
    },
